{"entities":[{"pmid":"6308526","text":"Naloxazone","etype":"Chemical","mesh":"C024224","start":0,"end":10},{"pmid":"6308526","text":"morphine","etype":"Chemical","mesh":"D009020","start":91,"end":99},{"pmid":"6308526","text":"morphine","etype":"Chemical","mesh":"D009020","start":164,"end":172},{"pmid":"6308526","text":"naloxazone","etype":"Chemical","mesh":"C024224","start":222,"end":232},{"pmid":"6308526","text":"naloxazone","etype":"Chemical","mesh":"C024224","start":306,"end":316},{"pmid":"6308526","text":"morphine","etype":"Chemical","mesh":"D009020","start":339,"end":347},{"pmid":"6308526","text":"analgesia","etype":"Disease","mesh":"D000699","start":348,"end":357},{"pmid":"6308526","text":"catalepsy","etype":"Disease","mesh":"D002375","start":359,"end":368},{"pmid":"6308526","text":"hypothermia","etype":"Disease","mesh":"D007035","start":373,"end":384},{"pmid":"6308526","text":"naloxazone","etype":"Chemical","mesh":"C024224","start":475,"end":485},{"pmid":"6308526","text":"morphine","etype":"Chemical","mesh":"D009020","start":515,"end":523},{"pmid":"6308526","text":"hypotension","etype":"Disease","mesh":"D007022","start":532,"end":543},{"pmid":"6308526","text":"respiratory depression","etype":"Disease","mesh":"D012131","start":548,"end":570},{"pmid":"6308526","text":"morphine","etype":"Chemical","mesh":"D009020","start":580,"end":588},{"pmid":"6308526","text":"bradycardia","etype":"Disease","mesh":"D001919","start":597,"end":608},{"pmid":"6308526","text":"morphine","etype":"Chemical","mesh":"D009020","start":749,"end":757}],"gold_relations":"morphine | CID | hypotension\nmorphine | CID | hypothermia\nmorphine | CID | catalepsy\nmorphine | CID | bradycardia","metrics":{"precision":0.3333333333333333,"recall":1.0,"f1":0.5,"tp":4,"fp":8,"fn":0,"rel_precision":0.3333333333333333,"rel_recall":1.0,"rel_f1":0.5,"rel_tp":4,"rel_fp":8,"rel_fn":0},"pmid":"6308526","relations":["C024224 | CID | D000699","C024224 | CID | D007035","D009020 | CID | D007035","D009020 | CID | D000699","D009020 | CID | D002375","D009020 | CID | D007022","C024224 | CID | D009020","C024224 | CID | D001919","C024224 | CID | D007022","C024224 | CID | D012131","D009020 | CID | D001919","C024224 | CID | D002375"],"text":"Naloxazone pretreatment modifies cardiorespiratory, temperature, and behavioral effects of morphine. Behavioral and cardiorespiratory responses to a lethal dose of morphine were evaluated in rats pretreated with saline or naloxazone, an antagonist of high-affinity mu 1 opioid receptors. Pretreatment with naloxazone significantly blocked morphine analgesia, catalepsy and hypothermia at a dose which completely eliminated high-affinity binding in brain membranes. Moreover, naloxazone significantly attenuated the morphine-induced hypotension and respiratory depression, whereas morphine-induced bradycardia was less affected. Results indicate that subpopulations of mu receptors may mediate selective behavioral and cardiorespiratory responses to morphine."}